<div id="shortcut-selection" class="joystick-selection-window">
	<h3 class="selection-title">为 <span class="item-name"></span> 选择快捷栏位</h3>
	<div class="tab-container">
		<div class="tab-buttons"></div>
		<div class="shortcut-grid"></div>
	</div>
	<div class="footer-instructions">
		使用 L2/R2 切换标签页，使用方向键选择栏位，按 A 确认，按 Select 取消
	</div>
</div>
